Successful registration:
Command:
curl -sS -w '\nHTTP status: %{http_code}\n' -X POST -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"username":"option1_user","password":"bookpass123"}' http://localhost:5000/register

Output:
{"message":"User successfully registered"}
HTTP status: 201

Duplicate username:
Command:
curl -sS -w '\nHTTP status: %{http_code}\n' -X POST -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"username":"option1_user","password":"bookpass123"}' http://localhost:5000/register

Output:
{"message":"Username already exists"}
HTTP status: 409

Missing username and password:
Command:
curl -sS -w '\nHTTP status: %{http_code}\n' -X POST -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{}' http://localhost:5000/register

Output:
{"message":"Username and password are required"}
HTTP status: 400